# Forge 48 / early 49 (Minecraft 1.20.2, 1.20.3): ResourceLocation has no static factories yet (Forge for 1.20.4 adds
# them, vanilla from 1.21): the constructor instead. After below-1.20.5.
regex	(?:net\.minecraft\.resources\.)?ResourceLocation\.(?:fromNamespaceAndPath|withDefaultNamespace|parse)\(	new net.minecraft.resources.ResourceLocation(
